
# ── CURATED GOLDEN TEST FIXTURE (see golden.json + make-golden-iso.sh) ─────────
# ToaruOS is a LiveCD guest (-cdrom image.iso -boot d, no qcow2, no -snapshot):
# no writable snapshottable device -> QMP savevm/loadvm NOT available. The
# remastered image.iso IS the golden artifact; reset = guest reboot.
SH_RESET_MODE=restart
SH_GOLDEN_MANIFEST=/data/vms/streamhost/tiles/toaruos/golden.json
SH_GOLDEN_ISO=/data/gallery-guests/toaruos/image.iso
SH_GOLDEN_ISO_BACKUP=/data/gallery-guests/toaruos/image.iso.golden-backup-1783370359
# Fixture: clean desktop; panel WITHOUT the per-second clock + weather widgets
# (their /lib panel .so removed) -> static at idle; first-boot tutorial + login
# toasts suppressed; a focused Terminal auto-starts as the input-reactive surface
# (keyboard=typed chars/arrow moves caret, mouse=Applications menu + desktop icons).
# Idle diff between two screendumps = only the 8x17 blinking-caret cell (~136px).
